OL,3,GNEWSA'Near miss' in harbour after boat
OL,4,Aruns red light
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "near miss" between a passenger ship
OL,7,Fand a cruise ship tender took place
OL,8,Flast weekend, Guernsey Ports has said.
OL,10,FHarbour master James Way said the
OL,11,Ftender had departed despite red signals
OL,12,Fbeing in place on Sunday at about 17:00
OL,13,FBST.
OL,15,FIt crossed in front of a passenger
OL,16,Fship, thought to be the San Pawl, "at
OL,17,Frelatively close range", he added.
OL,19,FWay said there had been "no immediate
OL,20,Fdanger or impact on passenger or vessel
OL,21,Fsafety" and the incident has been
OL,22,Fdiscussed with the cruise operator.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
